graph TD
    subgraph Data Sources
        PlaidAPI[Plaid API] -->|Transaction Data| TSvc[Transaction Service]
        PlaidAPI -->|Account Data| ASvc[Account Service]
    end

    subgraph Data Processing
        TSvc -->|Store| TModel[Transaction Model]
        ASvc -->|Store| BModel[Balance Model]

        TModel -->|Query| FinService[Financial Services]
        BModel -->|Query| FinService

        FinService -->|Process| TransDF[Transaction DataFrame]
        FinService -->|Calculate| MonthlySpend[Monthly Spending]
        FinService -->|Group By| Categories[Spending by Category]
        FinService -->|Sum| TotalBalance[Total Balance]
    end

    subgraph Visualization
        TransDF -->|Input for| Charts[Chart Generation]
        MonthlySpend -->|Display in| Dashboard[Dashboard Cards]
        Categories -->|Create| PieChart[Category Pie Chart]
        TotalBalance -->|Show in| AccSummary[Account Summary]
    end

    subgraph User Interface
        Dashboard --> UI[User Interface]
        PieChart --> UI
        AccSummary --> UI
        Charts --> UI
    end

    UI -->|View| User((User))